# Keeps cached fetches out of the deployment bundle.
#
# This file has to live HERE, not in the root .rscignore. rsconnect reads
# .rscignore from each directory as it scans it, so the root file only ever
# applies to root-level entries: neither "data/raw" nor a bare "raw" in the
# root file matches anything, and rsconnect gives no warning that the line
# did nothing.
#
# raw/ holds the AlphaFold PAE JSON cache (see .data_path("raw") in
# R/data.R) plus any raw download a data/prep/ script leaves behind. The app
# recreates the directory on first use, so nothing here is needed at deploy
# time, and shipping a stale local cache would be pointless bloat at best.
raw
